Secured and Monitored Web Infrastructure - www.foobar.com

User flow:
User types https://www.foobar.com
DNS resolves to load balancer IP
Request passes through Firewall 1
HAproxy (with SSL) receives request
HAproxy sends request to Server 2 or Server 3
Nginx -> Application server -> MySQL
Response returns to user

